# Drizzle snapshots are generated artifacts: they are a full schema dump per migration, grow
# with the schema, and nothing reads them. The migrator uses _journal.json plus the SQL, and
# drizzle-kit generate --custom bootstraps a fresh baseline. They added ~6.8M lines to a
# single PR before being ignored.
drizzle/meta/*_snapshot.json
